        {
          "author_name": "Jakub T.",
          "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104455765028807590418/reviews",
          "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKe275mc5uTBP82faRhzj93Lv6JJkgT_rE3qluxyHLTGyaMUA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
          "rating": 3,
          "text": "I was so happy when the branch opened that there was finally a tasty kebab in Petřiny again, but unfortunately it went downhill quickly. While at first they put the famous grilled vegetables for this chain in the dürum and drizzled it with lime, which created an interesting taste experience, today I only got unprepared cucumber, tomato and lettuce, no lime - together with the blandly spiced meat and sauces, it creates a very bland taste experience, for which I probably won't pay the money again.",
